                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Interview with artist Thomas Rentmeister about his highgloss sculptures focusing on the making process, materials and techniques, and intention of the work, including desired appearance. Against this background, the concept of damage and conservation is discussed.</p>"
